    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d734">

                <pb facs="0764" n="652" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg652"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/5049: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Davis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-08-16T12:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 16,
                                1919—12 noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received 11:25
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>2808. Following from [Cole at] Archangel.</p>
                <p>“1380, August 15th, 2 p.m. One thousand of the 1,200 Italian troops at Murmansk
                    are now embarked for repatriation. Cole.”</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Davis</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
